WEBVTT

00:11.630 --> 00:14.860
My mom took this same path to the highest dimension...

00:36.040 --> 00:37.000
I'm home!

00:37.740 --> 00:40.310
Welcome home, Shingo-kun.

00:40.780 --> 00:42.430
<i>Oh, yeah.</i>

00:42.430 --> 00:43.500
<i>That's right...</i>

00:44.000 --> 00:46.640
<i>That's the reason that I called him "Shingo."</i>

00:53.230 --> 00:56.330
You must be pretty confident to be smiling at a time like this.

00:56.330 --> 00:58.990
Huh? Was I smiling?

00:58.990 --> 01:00.660
Yes! Intensely!

01:01.740 --> 01:03.540
That's because I'm happy.

01:04.170 --> 01:06.370
I might be able to see my mom.

01:06.950 --> 01:09.000
There's no doubt about it, Toi-san!

01:09.690 --> 01:13.170
You're going to the highest dimension,
and you'll definitely find your mom.

01:13.540 --> 01:15.690
Yeah. You're right.

01:19.020 --> 01:20.200
The dimensional space is...

01:24.900 --> 01:27.100
Welcome to the 12th dimension!

01:33.540 --> 01:37.330
Th-The Creed Killer!? How are you alive!?

01:37.330 --> 01:41.320
Can't kick the bucket without givin' ya girlies a lil' payback, eh?

01:46.110 --> 01:47.570
Thank you, Yuma-chan!

01:47.570 --> 01:48.590
No prob!

01:48.590 --> 01:50.340
You little lower dimensional punks...

01:50.340 --> 01:54.000
I'll crush you all!

01:59.430 --> 02:01.090
W-What?!

02:01.090 --> 02:02.200
Please.

02:02.510 --> 02:04.220
Don't get in our way!

02:08.430 --> 02:10.350
I'm reading an increase in the DR reaction!

02:10.350 --> 02:12.770
It's surpassed Level 3!

02:12.770 --> 02:15.170
The dimensional hole has
increased in size again!

02:15.170 --> 02:17.030
It's not slowing down!

02:18.060 --> 02:19.840
Even though we can't see it,

02:19.840 --> 02:21.890
the world is ending right in front of us.

02:22.650 --> 02:26.750
And all we can do is entrust our fate to Matoi-san and the others.

02:26.750 --> 02:29.420
No. There is still one thing we can do.

02:29.420 --> 02:30.830
Exactly.

02:31.140 --> 02:35.410
Nights will attempt to come into our world through the hole that has opened.

02:35.410 --> 02:38.590
Until the girls close the gate to the highest dimension...

02:38.590 --> 02:41.980
...we have to protect this world ourselves!

02:41.980 --> 02:42.930
Isn't that right?

02:43.760 --> 02:44.510
Yes!

02:45.250 --> 02:47.170
This is the critical moment!

02:47.170 --> 02:50.800
We shall banish every demon
who dares comes down to our world!

02:50.800 --> 02:51.980
Yes, sir!

02:55.690 --> 02:57.090
<i>Matoi-san,</i>

02:57.090 --> 02:58.500
<i>I'll be praying for you.</i>

02:58.960 --> 03:01.910
<i>I'll be praying that you can
make it to the highest dimension.</i>

03:03.070 --> 03:04.500
<i>And that you'll...</i>

03:05.810 --> 03:07.280
<i>reunite with Shiori.</i>

03:08.830 --> 03:10.400
Ordinary is Best!

03:13.410 --> 03:16.370
Where's that power comin' from, missy?

03:16.370 --> 03:19.550
You're like a completely different person since we last met!

03:19.550 --> 03:22.510
'Nother one of Set's tricks, maybe?

03:22.800 --> 03:25.320
Oh, it aches. Everything aches...

03:25.320 --> 03:30.980
This oozing wound ya girlies gave me hurts like hell!

03:33.110 --> 03:34.670
Creed Killer!

03:34.670 --> 03:37.070
I'll be your opponent, you bastard!

03:37.600 --> 03:38.850
Go on without me.

03:38.850 --> 03:39.910
Clarus-san!

03:39.910 --> 03:42.070
I'll fight beside you!

03:43.690 --> 03:45.450
Have you two forgotten
what you wished for?

03:46.220 --> 03:47.970
You're going to the highest dimension, remember?

03:48.990 --> 03:50.260
It's all right.

03:50.260 --> 03:52.540
I won't go down so easy.

03:52.540 --> 03:54.750
What're ya babblin' about!?

03:56.210 --> 03:57.790
Go!

03:57.790 --> 03:58.400
But...

03:58.400 --> 03:59.750
Believe in me!

04:01.450 --> 04:02.480
Toi-san!

04:07.920 --> 04:09.790
Just wait for us, Clarus-san.

04:09.790 --> 04:11.200
We'll be back soon!

04:16.090 --> 04:18.270
Now I can fight you without holding back!

04:18.270 --> 04:20.600
Don't get full of yerself, missy!

04:35.050 --> 04:37.340
Is that all you've got?

04:37.340 --> 04:40.090
Shut yer trap.

04:43.980 --> 04:46.000
Quaedum Fulmen!

04:53.650 --> 04:55.230
I knew it.

04:56.090 --> 04:58.190
You're just a buncha scrap.

04:58.700 --> 05:02.080
Hit yer limit this high up.

05:02.080 --> 05:05.150
Ain't that right, little miss Anti-Creed?

05:06.070 --> 05:07.930
Poor thing.

05:07.930 --> 05:11.620
Now comes the fun part.

05:17.900 --> 05:19.600
There are demons here too!

05:21.990 --> 05:24.790
Please, just let me keep going.

05:24.790 --> 05:26.510
Shingo-san's waiting for us.

05:27.120 --> 05:30.970
My dad is trusting mom
and me to come back home!

05:31.540 --> 05:32.470
Toi-san!

05:32.470 --> 05:33.600
Yuma-chan!

05:43.440 --> 05:44.510
Um, excuse me...

05:48.320 --> 05:49.170
There's another one!

05:49.170 --> 05:49.740
Right!

05:49.740 --> 05:50.950
Demons...

05:50.950 --> 05:52.030
...begone!

06:00.080 --> 06:01.600
It's all right now.

06:01.600 --> 06:03.380
Thank you so much!

06:03.600 --> 06:04.800
Yayoi!?

06:05.280 --> 06:08.170
With Matoi-san and everyone else fighting for their lives,

06:08.170 --> 06:10.800
I couldn't just sit back and watch.

06:11.290 --> 06:14.810
The Nights are wasting no time possessing the whole city!

06:14.810 --> 06:17.520
At this rate, we're going to be overrun!

06:17.520 --> 06:19.520
The numbers are becoming overwhelming.

06:19.520 --> 06:20.510
What's the situation over there?

06:20.510 --> 06:21.870
It's not just France.

06:21.870 --> 06:24.480
Reports of unusual phenomena are coming in from all over the world!

06:26.080 --> 06:27.300
The Regalia...

06:27.820 --> 06:28.650
It can't be...

06:29.380 --> 06:30.450
Clarus!

06:37.920 --> 06:39.680
What a lovely view we got 'ere!

06:39.680 --> 06:41.790
Whatcha think, little miss Anti-Creed?

06:42.610 --> 06:45.190
Why haven't you...

06:45.190 --> 06:47.260
Why bother finishin' ya off?

06:47.560 --> 06:50.920
Your higher dimensional being's gonna disappear soon anyway.

06:50.920 --> 06:55.000
And when that happens, your body won't be able to exist in this dimension.

06:55.440 --> 06:56.720
Basically,

06:56.720 --> 06:59.000
you'll cease to exist!

07:01.500 --> 07:04.530
Are you gonna pray to that sonovabitch ya call a god!?

07:05.220 --> 07:06.480
Pray...

07:06.480 --> 07:07.510
Huh?

07:07.510 --> 07:08.610
Who do I pray to?

07:09.680 --> 07:13.070
<i>I don't have a god to pray to...</i>

07:13.740 --> 07:17.830
<i>I carried out my will to fight and accomplished nothing.</i>

07:17.830 --> 07:19.540
<i>Nobody will ever know my name.</i>

07:21.400 --> 07:22.530
<i>Flors-san,</i>

07:23.250 --> 07:24.960
<i>it looks like I'll be dying first.</i>

07:29.830 --> 07:31.050
Quit lying to yourself.

07:32.690 --> 07:34.860
You're going because you want to.

07:36.160 --> 07:38.730
Not as an Anti-Creed of Fatima,

07:39.630 --> 07:41.800
but as Clarus Tonitorus,

07:42.300 --> 07:44.980
protecting what's important to her.

07:45.990 --> 07:48.000
<i>The things that are important to me...</i>

07:48.480 --> 07:49.750
<i>The things I want to protect...</i>

07:50.480 --> 07:53.660
<i>I've known all along,
but I pretended like I didn't.</i>

07:54.770 --> 07:57.870
<i>The time I spent with those two was so much fun.</i>

08:00.240 --> 08:01.190
<i>That's why...</i>

08:01.860 --> 08:03.130
<i>I want to protect them.</i>

08:13.380 --> 08:15.260
I-Isn't this...

08:15.260 --> 08:18.680
I'm sorry that this is the first time I've spoken to you properly.

08:20.360 --> 08:24.980
But I'm wishing for this from the bottom of my heart.

08:25.790 --> 08:27.100
I want...

08:28.030 --> 08:28.980
to protect my friends!

08:35.820 --> 08:38.500
An attack from a higher dimension?

08:39.190 --> 08:40.450
Toi-san.

08:40.450 --> 08:41.900
Don't worry about me.

08:41.900 --> 08:43.760
Go on ahead!

08:43.760 --> 08:45.510
I can't just leave you behind!

08:47.850 --> 08:49.260
Toi-san!

08:53.600 --> 08:55.260
Is that lightning?

08:55.530 --> 08:56.750
Clarus-san?

09:00.910 --> 09:03.150
What the hell are you girls!?

09:03.150 --> 09:06.100
Yer just third-dimensional trash!

09:06.100 --> 09:08.200
Quit pissin' me off!

09:08.710 --> 09:11.230
I won't let myself despise you anymore.

09:11.230 --> 09:12.150
Huh?

09:12.150 --> 09:14.800
All I want is for my wish to come true!

09:24.800 --> 09:27.790
What're ya goin' on about?

09:28.190 --> 09:32.660
<i>I made the right wish, right, Flors-san?</i>

09:34.320 --> 09:36.680
Toi-san, they just keep coming!

09:36.680 --> 09:37.700
Yeah.

09:43.130 --> 09:45.040
This is only the 15th dimension.

09:45.040 --> 09:46.830
Why are you two dawdling?

09:46.830 --> 09:47.960
Clarus-san!

09:47.960 --> 09:49.480
You made it!

09:49.480 --> 09:51.060
And that outfit...

09:51.060 --> 09:52.110
Explanations later.

09:52.680 --> 09:54.360
Matoi, Yuma,

09:54.360 --> 09:55.530
let's go.

10:02.280 --> 10:06.000
Clarus-san, you just called us by
our names for the first time.

10:06.000 --> 10:07.310
Really?

10:07.310 --> 10:08.600
Sure you did.

10:09.120 --> 10:10.500
Who cares?

10:10.850 --> 10:12.380
That's trivial.

10:12.380 --> 10:14.430
It's important!

10:14.430 --> 10:15.260
Really?

10:15.590 --> 10:18.300
Then I'll keep doing it.

10:18.300 --> 10:19.140
Okay!

10:19.140 --> 10:19.890
Yeah!

10:23.390 --> 10:24.790
<i>Humans...</i>

10:24.790 --> 10:27.650
<i>Lifeforms residing in the third dimension.</i>

10:28.190 --> 10:33.020
<i>In such a low dimension containing nothing
but space, they have no way of stopping time,</i>

10:33.020 --> 10:35.320
<i>so they instead choose to squander it.</i>

10:36.270 --> 10:39.330
<i>Why are they so frantic to protect this world?</i>

10:44.200 --> 10:47.710
<i>This fleeting, fragile world.</i>

10:51.420 --> 10:53.050
<i>We're doing fine here, got it?</i>

10:53.050 --> 10:56.900
<i>Don't worry about us.
Just make sure your daughter is safe!</i>

10:57.420 --> 10:59.510
<i>That's right. I need to protect people, too!</i>

10:59.510 --> 11:00.820
<i>Until Matoi...</i>

11:00.820 --> 11:04.510
<i>Until Matoi and Shiori come back,
I need to protect this town!</i>

11:04.780 --> 11:06.050
<i>Sumeragi Shiori,</i>

11:06.050 --> 11:10.000
<i>the first one to stop this dimension's
endless cycle of destruction and rebirth.</i>

11:10.590 --> 11:14.620
<i>How is it that she could attain such power?</i>

11:16.050 --> 11:20.450
<i>I've led her daughter down the path to
becoming a shrine maiden of Divine Union.</i>

11:20.450 --> 11:23.330
<i>I made certain she could harness the power of the Myriads.</i>

11:24.670 --> 11:26.260
I can't help but wonder.

11:26.560 --> 11:29.910
What is the source of their power?

11:30.450 --> 11:32.120
The dimensional space is falling apart!

11:35.530 --> 11:38.210
Yuma and I are hitting our limits.

11:38.520 --> 11:39.230
Huh?

11:39.230 --> 11:40.130
Here it comes!

11:46.520 --> 11:48.090
Mom!

11:52.270 --> 11:54.990
Whoa, it's so hot!

11:54.990 --> 11:56.840
Is it the Nights?

11:56.840 --> 11:57.830
No.

11:57.830 --> 12:00.800
Your true enemy isn't the Nights.

12:01.380 --> 12:02.700
The dimension itself...

12:02.700 --> 12:05.200
...is rejecting our existence within it.

12:08.670 --> 12:11.600
We only have a little further to go.

12:12.490 --> 12:14.760
But I can't—

12:14.760 --> 12:16.040
Not yet!

12:16.040 --> 12:16.890
Yuma-chan!

12:16.890 --> 12:19.630
It's too soon to give up, Toi-san!

12:21.360 --> 12:23.290
We're making our wishes come true, aren't we?

12:23.290 --> 12:24.900
Clarus-san!

12:24.900 --> 12:26.760
Even if we can't do it by ourselves...

12:27.510 --> 12:28.470
Yeah.

12:29.050 --> 12:30.560
We are together...

12:37.940 --> 12:40.690
We're all going to the highest dimension!

12:40.690 --> 12:41.430
Okay!

12:41.430 --> 12:42.450
Yeah!

12:58.970 --> 13:01.260
Guys, we made it!

13:01.260 --> 13:03.420
The highest dimension's just ahead—

13:08.060 --> 13:10.090
Toi-san, don't stop.

13:10.090 --> 13:12.520
Don't worry about us. Keep pushing forward.

13:12.520 --> 13:15.190
I can't! I can't do that!

13:15.190 --> 13:18.300
Toi-san, make my wish...

13:18.300 --> 13:20.230
Make... my wish...

13:21.380 --> 13:22.940
come true!

13:28.870 --> 13:30.220
Yuma-chan.

13:30.220 --> 13:31.630
Clarus-san.

13:31.630 --> 13:33.500
You knew what was going to happen, but you...

13:34.010 --> 13:35.370
I'll come back for you.

13:35.370 --> 13:37.370
I swear it.

13:38.060 --> 13:40.300
Where's the gate to the highest dimension?

13:40.710 --> 13:43.370
Where's Mom?

13:44.800 --> 13:46.800
God, please.

13:46.800 --> 13:48.500
Just a little bit longer.

13:48.810 --> 13:51.640
Yuma-chan and Clarus-san...

13:52.360 --> 13:56.170
guided me this far...

13:56.170 --> 13:58.940
I can't just give up now!

14:03.480 --> 14:04.880
Mom...

14:09.350 --> 14:11.740
Somebody! Someone, please help!

14:12.470 --> 14:14.850
Hey, are you still alive?

14:14.850 --> 14:15.810
Damn it!

14:15.810 --> 14:18.760
Where the hell are the police
and fire department!?

14:18.760 --> 14:21.380
It's all right now. I'll save you!

14:22.380 --> 14:23.550
No.

14:23.550 --> 14:25.190
If I give up now...

14:30.280 --> 14:31.300
What are these?

14:32.840 --> 14:34.260
Wishes?

14:34.620 --> 14:37.310
Yuma-chan and Clarus-san's wishes.

14:51.130 --> 14:52.620
A good luck charm?

14:52.620 --> 14:54.410
Is it Shingo-san's?

14:54.410 --> 14:55.780
No, that's wrong.

14:56.170 --> 14:59.320
This charm has to be my mother's.

15:06.000 --> 15:07.300
A gate.

15:07.840 --> 15:09.350
And on the other side...

15:09.670 --> 15:12.600
Mom, it's me, Matoi!

15:12.600 --> 15:15.720
Mom! Your daughter is here, Matoi!

15:15.720 --> 15:17.430
I came to get you!

15:17.430 --> 15:20.020
Let's go home together, Mom!

15:20.270 --> 15:21.350
Mom!

15:24.330 --> 15:25.700
Why?

15:26.040 --> 15:28.150
I can't reach the gate.

15:28.150 --> 15:30.820
<i>Your voice won't reach your mother.</i>

15:31.070 --> 15:35.780
<i>Sumeragi Shiori has assimilated with her god
and has herself become the gate.</i>

15:35.780 --> 15:38.290
<i>She is the only thing stopping the unification of every dimension.</i>

15:39.210 --> 15:42.580
<i>You should try and force the gate open, Sumeragi Shiori will cease to exist,</i>

15:42.580 --> 15:44.750
<i>and all dimensions shall unify into one.</i>

15:45.280 --> 15:48.900
<i>The world you live in and your very existence will change completely.</i>

15:49.290 --> 15:52.790
<i>However, Sumeragi Shiori is reaching her limits.</i>

15:52.790 --> 15:56.930
<i>If your goal is to hold the gate closed, you must become part of it as well.</i>

15:57.400 --> 16:01.670
<i>Now, make your choice, Sumeragi Matoi.</i>

16:01.670 --> 16:03.410
<i>The dimensions rest in your hands.</i>

16:03.810 --> 16:05.060
Not yet.

16:05.480 --> 16:06.790
Not yet!

16:06.790 --> 16:07.770
God...

16:09.460 --> 16:12.060
my wish is to live with Shingo-san—

16:12.060 --> 16:15.830
No, with my father and my mother.

16:16.170 --> 16:18.750
I don't need anything special.

16:18.750 --> 16:20.540
I don't mind being ordinary.

16:20.540 --> 16:24.370
All I want are the things that every family has!

16:25.210 --> 16:27.570
I want to make this wish come true,
no matter what it takes!

16:27.890 --> 16:29.700
There's nothing I can't do.

16:30.180 --> 16:31.880
Because I can feel them.

16:32.490 --> 16:34.400
My mother's feelings...

16:36.170 --> 16:38.000
My mother's wishes!

16:49.830 --> 16:51.890
I know it's unfair to ask this of you,

16:51.890 --> 16:57.290
since you gave up your life as a shrine maiden to live happily as a normal woman.

16:57.290 --> 17:02.940
But you are the only one who has the power to stop the dimensional hole from expanding.

17:02.940 --> 17:05.260
I'm begging you, Shiori!

17:05.260 --> 17:07.480
<i>Don't worry, I know.</i>

17:07.780 --> 17:13.050
<i>Mom, I know that you chose to go to
the highest dimension for Dad and me.</i>

17:13.640 --> 17:16.260
<i>I know that you love Dad.</i>

17:16.740 --> 17:18.420
I work here.

17:18.420 --> 17:20.700
Huh? O-Oh, I see.

17:21.060 --> 17:22.000
U-Um...

17:22.000 --> 17:24.100
I remember the delicious-smelling curry,

17:24.590 --> 17:26.270
the fun songs that you hummed...

17:27.840 --> 17:30.440
I understand why you left.

17:30.940 --> 17:32.380
I understand!

17:33.720 --> 17:35.480
I don't want to go.

17:35.480 --> 17:36.990
I want to stay

17:37.470 --> 17:39.840
with Shingo-kun and Matoi...

17:41.320 --> 17:43.300
Don't cry, Mom.

17:43.830 --> 17:45.700
I'll come get you.

17:46.150 --> 17:47.500
That voice...

17:47.970 --> 17:49.300
Is that you, Matoi?

17:49.820 --> 17:51.750
It's me, ten years later.

17:52.210 --> 17:54.880
Mom, just give me a few more moments.

17:55.420 --> 17:57.290
I swear I'm coming to get you!

17:58.960 --> 18:01.380
Dad's waiting, trusting us both.

18:01.780 --> 18:03.660
And everyone is making their own wishes.

18:04.310 --> 18:05.590
So...

18:05.590 --> 18:07.350
You make a wish too, Mom.

18:23.580 --> 18:25.800
O, wishes of the many,

18:29.240 --> 18:30.120
be...

18:34.040 --> 18:35.750
<i>Matoi...</i>

18:35.750 --> 18:36.800
<i>Shiori...</i>

18:37.520 --> 18:38.620
...granted!

18:47.850 --> 18:50.400
I've been waiting for you, Matoi.

18:50.820 --> 18:51.700
I know.

19:08.000 --> 19:10.370
How adorable! How old is he?

19:10.780 --> 19:12.970
He just turned two.

19:12.300 --> 19:14.840
Oh, that's the cutest age!

19:12.970 --> 19:14.840
Could it be?

19:15.480 --> 19:17.940
The demonic auras have all vanished.

19:17.940 --> 19:19.920
She really did it?

19:22.520 --> 19:23.640
Matoi-san!

19:24.390 --> 19:27.000
Matoi-san did it.

19:27.320 --> 19:29.600
Now it's our turn to make a wish.

19:29.960 --> 19:30.850
You're right.

19:31.230 --> 19:34.240
Please, come back safely.

19:37.400 --> 19:38.680
<i>Inconceivable.</i>

19:38.680 --> 19:41.590
<i>It seems she upon called
the Myriads of every dimension</i>

19:41.590 --> 19:44.620
<i>and rewrote the very fabric of the universe.</i>

19:45.260 --> 19:46.870
<i>"I want to be ordinary."</i>

19:46.870 --> 19:50.580
<i>Such a simple wish is the root of their power.</i>

19:51.030 --> 19:55.040
<i>Humans never fail to entertain.</i>

19:56.950 --> 19:59.530
What have I been doing all this time?

19:59.530 --> 20:02.360
Wait, why am I up here!?

20:02.360 --> 20:04.010
I-I'm scared!

20:04.010 --> 20:05.400
Somebody, help!

20:06.390 --> 20:08.430
Are you alive, Yuma?

20:08.430 --> 20:11.640
Kuu-san and Kai-san are doing their best,

20:11.640 --> 20:13.500
but I don't think I can—

20:13.770 --> 20:16.390
I wonder if Matoi's wish came true?

20:16.790 --> 20:19.320
I'm sure it did.

20:21.530 --> 20:22.660
What?

20:38.970 --> 20:40.830
Something smells nice.

20:40.830 --> 20:42.250
Is it curry?

20:42.250 --> 20:43.690
That's right.

20:43.690 --> 20:44.550
Matoi?

20:45.800 --> 20:47.500
I had a dream.

20:48.030 --> 20:51.640
I dreamt that Shiori disappeared, and then you disappeared.

20:52.480 --> 20:55.320
But I trusted you, and kept waiting.

20:55.320 --> 21:00.270
All I could do was keep wishing for you two to come home.

21:00.840 --> 21:02.560
What was I—

21:02.560 --> 21:04.850
That dream came true.

21:08.450 --> 21:09.600
Shiori?

21:09.990 --> 21:10.910
Matoi...

21:11.260 --> 21:15.160
Sh-Shiori? Is it really you?

21:15.160 --> 21:17.170
Who does it look like?

21:18.040 --> 21:20.110
You look exactly the same...

21:20.110 --> 21:22.130
The same as the day you left...

21:22.130 --> 21:23.990
Hold it! You haven't changed a bit.

21:23.990 --> 21:25.180
How?

21:25.180 --> 21:26.300
Who cares...

21:26.890 --> 21:28.510
...about that?

21:29.050 --> 21:30.890
I'm home, Shingo-kun.

21:31.580 --> 21:33.020
I'm home,

21:33.020 --> 21:34.060
Dad.

21:35.080 --> 21:37.360
Shiori... Matoi...

21:39.030 --> 21:40.440
Welcome home.

21:51.690 --> 21:55.500
<i>Thank you for granting my wish, God.</i>

21:57.210 --> 21:58.330
<i>Goodbye.</i>

22:03.890 --> 22:05.370
Dad!

22:05.370 --> 22:06.300
Matoi.

22:07.260 --> 22:08.260
Mom!

22:10.390 --> 22:12.050
My wish came true.

22:14.130 --> 22:16.020
Being ordinary is the best!

23:14.580 --> 23:15.910
Shingo-kun!

23:15.910 --> 23:17.290
Shi!

23:17.680 --> 23:22.730
If those two keep carrying on like this,
Matoi's gonna have a sibling soon.

23:23.140 --> 23:24.670
Should we do that, too?

23:24.990 --> 23:26.960
D-Do!? Like <i>do</i> do? I'll do my best!

23:27.590 --> 23:29.080
What is this feeling of alienation?

23:29.080 --> 23:32.430
Am I going to have to watch them act all lovey-dovey every day?

23:33.510 --> 23:36.180
This is completely different from what I imagined!

23:36.180 --> 23:37.130
Toi-san!

23:37.130 --> 23:41.290
Luciela-sensei just called us.
They found a buncha demons that survived!

23:41.290 --> 23:45.300
Wait, Yuma-chan. I don't have a god any—

23:45.960 --> 23:47.670
If you would, please.

23:47.670 --> 23:48.290
Huh?

23:49.270 --> 23:50.610
No way!

23:52.150 --> 23:53.660
Why are you still here?

23:54.050 --> 23:57.240
Come on! The Exorcist Girls have got work to do!

23:57.240 --> 23:59.200
<i>I-I'm still not ordinary!</i>

23:59.200 --> 24:00.910
Take care!

24:00.910 --> 24:02.940
This isn't ordinary!

24:02.940 --> 24:07.430
This isn't ordinary! Mom! Dad!
